{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ca1f26dcc7a7baa1ba40e3ad8654618eb81a4bec09b8a325a40d4c9b144a70f9","digest":{"component_or_area":"Makefile and CI typecheck gate","key_entities":["Makefile:241-242","src/rebar","scripts/","pyproject.toml",".github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml:108",".pre-commit-config.yaml:57","tests/unit/test_typecheck_scope.py","scripts/check_raw_git_writes.py","scripts/plan_review_impact_distribution.py","scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py","scripts/probe_rebar.py","scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py","scripts/t5c_calibrate.py"],"problem_keywords":["typecheck scope","mypy","scripts directory","type checking","type annotations"],"propositions":["The typecheck Makefile target runs mypy only over src/rebar but excludes scripts/, even though scripts/ files are linted and some are invoked as CI gate implementations.","Widening mypy scope to include scripts/ exposes 15 fixable type errors across 6 script files, including two latent bugs where None narrowing was lost or missing.","The sys.path bootstrap mutations in 9 scripts/ files do not require special mypy configuration because pyproject.toml already sets follow_imports=silent and ignore_missing_imports=true.","The typecheck recipe and its descriptions in Makefile, .pre-commit-config.yaml, and .github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml must be kept in sync per Makefile declaration that CI and pre-commit mirror Makefile 1:1."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787411220523807001,"uuid":"92afac26-5aaa-4203-967f-ddba86472601"}